  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">(4 fotos) La noche de este martes, Tales ha sufrido diferentes actos vand&aacute;licos en bienes municipales, que han producido da&ntilde;os materiales y econ&oacute;micos de gran envergadura por un total de 6.000&euro;.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/07/09bc934d-907a-4200-9450-8caf8ab82889.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 640px;\" /><br style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\" />\n <span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">El Ayuntamiento ya ha interpuesto la correspondiente denuncia a la Guardia Civil, que abrir&aacute; una investigaci&oacute;n al respecto.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actesvandalicstales/09bc934d-907a-4200-9450-8caf8ab82889.JPG\" alt=\"09bc934d-907a-4200-9450-8caf8ab82889\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actesvandalicstales/291cc39e-d55e-4031-85e8-063268425036.JPG\" alt=\"291cc39e-d55e-4031-85e8-063268425036\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actesvandalicstales/737b5ff3-3cc0-49a7-90ee-b0da38d414e7 (1).JPG\" alt=\"737b5ff3-3cc0-49a7-90ee-b0da38d414e7 (1)\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actesvandalicstales/737b5ff3-3cc0-49a7-90ee-b0da38d414e7.JPG\" alt=\"737b5ff3-3cc0-49a7-90ee-b0da38d414e7\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actesvandalicstales/whatsapp-image-2021-07-01-at-13-02-51.jpg\" alt=\"whatsapp-image-2021-07-01-at-13-02-51\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
